{
 "purpose": "Honest cost comparison for a merchant who stops taking UPI at month-end to stay under ₹1 lakh. Cover these points in order, with the numbers from the facts: (1) last month's UPI and that it is under ₹1 lakh, so no fee applies now; (2) if monthly UPI went above ₹1 lakh, the fee under the proposed framework would be about fee_if_above_1_lakh a month, because it applies only to the value_above_2000 of payments above ₹2,000 and payments of ₹2,000 or less are never charged; (3) our estimate of the sales taken in cash at month-end instead of UPI; (4) the required line, exactly. Do not copy the message templates in the policy section; they are for other cases. Do not tell them what to do. Promise nothing about loans.",
 "facts": {
  "merchant": "Sur Restaurant",
  "owner_first_name": "Yochana",
  "language": "Kannada",
  "month": "October 2026",
  "monthly_upi_value": "₹91,371",
  "value_above_2000": "₹21,975",
  "fee_if_above_1_lakh": "₹88",
  "month_end_cash_estimate": "₹11,000",
  "fee_rule": "0.4% only on UPI payments above ₹2,000, capped at ₹300 per payment; payments of ₹2,000 or less are never charged; monthly UPI under ₹1 lakh is exempt (proposed framework)",
  "required_line": "Payments you take digitally are recorded. Recorded sales are the history lenders look at when they assess an application."
 },
 "policy_section": {
  "ref": "Retention playbook §6.2",
  "text": "Retention playbook §6.2 Charges and fees: Fee estimate message\n\n**6.2 Fee estimate message.** Use the merchant's own numbers from the last full month. Say \"proposed framework\" until the final notification.\n\n> Under the proposed framework, a 0.4% fee applies to UPI payments above ₹2,000, capped at ₹300 per payment. Merchants with monthly UPI under ₹1 lakh are exempt. Last month you received ₹{value_above_2000} in UPI payments above ₹2,000. Your estimated fee is about ₹{est_monthly_fee} a month. Payments of ₹2,000 or less are not charged.\n\n**Not-affected variants.** Pick the variant from the merchant's data for the last full month.\n\n*A. Exempt (monthly UPI under ₹1 lakh):*\n\n> Under the proposed framework, the new UPI fee does not apply to you. Your monthly UPI is ₹{monthly_upi_value}, under the ₹1 lakh exemption. Nothing changes for you.\n\n*B. Above ₹1 lakh, but no payments above ₹2,000:*\n\n> Under the proposed framework, the fee applies only to UPI payments above ₹2,000. Your UPI payments are all ₹2,000 or less, so the fee does not apply to you.\n\nSend the not-affected message once. Do not follow it with offers."
 }
}

